      "description": "Flux HelmRelease chart versions: a release inside the range changes nothing, a release past the ceiling opens a reviewed PR that raises the ceiling and keeps the floor. timestamp-optional because the OCI chart registries on ghcr.io publish no release timestamp and the default, timestamp-required, would hold their updates as pending forever",
